There's a program called NHSOUND which does what you're looking for. The 
sound effects supplied with it are kinda cheesy, but you can replace them 
with your own VOCs. It works by looking for text on the message line, 
e.g. "The door opens" will trigger DOOROPEN.VOC and so forth. In other 
words, you can add your own sounds for whatever messages you like best. 
Kinda fun.

